Subject: [PATCH] pinouts: add the C5_ILI9341 board selector

Needed by boards/C5-ILI9341 (Waveshare ESP32-C5-WIFI6-KIT + 2.8in ILI9341 touch).
Bruce picks each board pin file here from a define set in the board .ini.
---
diff --git a/boards/pinouts/pins_arduino.h b/boards/pinouts/pins_arduino.h
--- a/boards/pinouts/pins_arduino.h
+++ b/boards/pinouts/pins_arduino.h
@@ -48,6 +48,8 @@
 #include "../lilygo-t-hmi/pins_arduino.h"
 #elif ELECROW
 #include "../elecrow/pins_arduino.h"
+#elif C5_ILI9341
+#include "../C5-ILI9341/pins_arduino.h"
 #elif ESP32C5_DEVKITC_1_TFT
 #include "../ESP32-C5-tft/pins_arduino.h"
 #elif ESP32C5_DEVKITC_1
